  "goodToKnow": "Igitt is an interjection of disgust, like yuck or ugh: Igitt, ein Haar in der Suppe! Children say igittigitt for emphasis. Similar: pfui (said to dogs and naughty children, pfui Teufel), bäh, iih. A disgusting thing is eklig or ekelhaft. It may come from a contraction of o Gott."
